          <NOTE type="x-studynote">on high: Heb. in the high places</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="20">My <gr str="7453">friends </gr>
        <gr str="3887">scorn </gr>me: <STYLE css="font-style:italic">but</STYLE> my <gr str="5869">eye </gr>poureth <gr str="1811">out </gr>
