          <NOTE type="x-studynote">scorn me: Heb. are my scorners</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="21">O that one might <gr str="3198">plead </gr>for a <gr str="1397">man </gr>with <gr str="433">God</gr>, as a <gr str="120">man </gr>
